    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #338\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to branch `bb/relay-132-approval-baseline-03-03-show-one-globa-thr_fvp2mxiwha` (new commit `1db85c2` on top of `5f6cfbb`).\n\nThis commit addresses the code review / CI feedback on PR #338:\n- **AC #7 (blocking)**: added `GET /api/agent-runs/:id` and a new `AgentRunDetail` frontend view (`?page=agent-run&id=<id>`), and turned the approval queue's agent-run reference into a real `<a href>` link so it's navigable.\n- **Low-severity finding**: added the missing `.approval-queue__id` CSS rule.\n- Full backend and frontend test suites, lint, format, build, and dependency-boundary checks all pass (one unrelated, pre-existing flaky test in `propertyTypeMigration.test.ts` was confirmed reliable in isolation and does not affect the overall test run's exit status).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
